-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/5 (25.2.2026): עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה בחטיבה העליונה ובכיתות יג'-יד' ועדכון תוספת 87' מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים בעוז לתמורה
-- The 2016 shekel supplement and the principals' '87 reform-transition
-- supplement, linked to the consumer price index, from 1.1.2026.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in calendar months of 2026
-- (January 2026 = 1, February = 2, March = 3).

§ `תשפ"ו/5 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 ותוספת 87'`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (25.2.2026), reference, addressee and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `employee group` IS ONE OF
    `teacher in Oz LaTmura`
    `teacher outside Oz LaTmura or principal`

DECLARE `supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the updated supplements with retroactive differences from January 2026` HAS `supplements paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owning bodies under topic 558` HAS `reimbursed` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owning bodies in the relevant hour costs`

-- The preamble: under the wage agreements of 23.3.2017 (§4ד) and 14.3.2018
-- (§§5א(ב), 5ב(ב)) and circular תשפ"ד/5, the 2016 shekel supplement is
-- linked to the consumer price index; this circular updates it from
-- 1.1.2026, by the index of December 2025 (published January 2026) against
-- that of December 2024 (published January 2025).
@ref akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN `index of December 2025` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2024` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` `index of December 2025` `index of December 2024` IS
    `index of December 2025` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2024`

-- Scope: every employee graded as teaching staff, employed by a supervised
-- owning body, in the upper divisions or grades 13-14, whether under Oz
-- LaTmura or not.
@ref akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18
GIVEN `graded as teaching staff` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed by a supervised owning body` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed in an upper division or grades 13-14` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` `graded as teaching staff` `employed by a supervised owning body` `employed in an upper division or grades 13-14` IF
        `graded as teaching staff`
    AND `employed by a supervised owning body`
    AND `employed in an upper division or grades 13-14`

§§ `א עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016`

-- From 1.1.2026, monthly, in place of the earlier amount.
@ref akn:art_a/p1 akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3
GIVEN g IS AN `employee group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2026` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `teacher in Oz LaTmura` THEN 1647.42
    WHEN `teacher outside Oz LaTmura or principal` THEN 1393.07

@ref akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3
GIVEN g IS AN `employee group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement before 1.1.2026` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `teacher in Oz LaTmura` THEN 1605.05
    WHEN `teacher outside Oz LaTmura or principal` THEN 1357.24

-- The owning bodies are reimbursed in the relevant hour costs in the
-- payments system. The costs are not stated, so no amount is encoded, and
-- no month is named, so there is no deadline.
@ref akn:art_a/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `the reimbursement in the hour costs` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owning bodies in the relevant hour costs`

§§ `ב עדכון תוספת 87' מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים`

-- Under the agreement and section 18 of circular תשע"ח/9: the '87
-- reform-transition supplement of principals in Oz LaTmura is to be
-- updated by the same index, to 1,201.86 a month from 1.1.2026; its
-- payment is the last paragraph's duty.
@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_b/p2
`the principals' '87 supplement from 1.1.2026` MEANS 1201.86

@ref akn:art_b/p2
`the principals' '87 supplement before 1.1.2026` MEANS 1170.95

-- All three updates are one linkage: each new amount is the old one times
-- the same factor, to the agora.
`the factor the Oz LaTmura amount implies` MEANS
    `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2026` `teacher in Oz LaTmura`
        DIVIDED BY `the 2016 shekel supplement before 1.1.2026` `teacher in Oz LaTmura`

GIVEN old IS A NUMBER, new IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `linked by the same factor to the agora` old new IF
    LET d MEANS old TIMES `the factor the Oz LaTmura amount implies` MINUS new
    IN  d LESS THAN 0.005 AND d GREATER THAN -0.005

#ASSERT `linked by the same factor to the agora` (`the 2016 shekel supplement before 1.1.2026` `teacher outside Oz LaTmura or principal`) (`the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2026` `teacher outside Oz LaTmura or principal`)
#ASSERT `linked by the same factor to the agora` `the principals' '87 supplement before 1.1.2026` `the principals' '87 supplement from 1.1.2026`

-- The last paragraph: pay both supplements at their updated values,
-- including retroactive differences, from January 2026. The circular names
-- the first month owed and no month by which the arrears are paid, so the
-- duty carries no deadline.
@ref akn:art_b/p5
GIVEN `owed from January 2026` IS A NUMBER @desc the updated supplements owed for the months from January 2026 to the month of payment
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `the updated supplements paid` `owed from January 2026` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the updated supplements with retroactive differences from January 2026` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `owed from January 2026`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/5 §ב: the updated supplements, with retroactive differences from January 2026"

-- The reimbursement of the '87 supplement: transferred in February 2026's
-- payments under topic 558, retroactive to January 2026, paid at the start
-- of March 2026.
@ref akn:art_b/p3 akn:art_b/p4
GIVEN `owed for January and February` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `the reimbursement under topic 558` `owed for January and February` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owning bodies under topic 558` r
          PROVIDED r AT LEAST `owed for January and February`
    WITHIN 3
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/5 §ב: reimbursement in the February 2026 payments, retroactive to January, paid early March 2026"

-- akn:conclusions The signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples.
#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2026` `teacher in Oz LaTmura` MINUS `the 2016 shekel supplement before 1.1.2026` `teacher in Oz LaTmura` EQUALS 42.37
#ASSERT `the circular applies to` TRUE TRUE TRUE

#TRACE `the updated supplements paid` 3294.84 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the updated supplements with retroactive differences from January 2026` 3294.84 AT 3
#TRACE `the reimbursement under topic 558` 2403.72 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owning bodies under topic 558` 2403.72 AT 3
